## Hollowtown

::bg{location="player-house" time="morning"}
::music{action="start" mood="calm" volume="down"}
::auto{character="mom" anchor="right" action="enter"}
@mom{emotion="happy"}: The Champion, sleeping in my spare room. The neighbours won't stop knocking.
@mom: Kai came by. He said to tell you he's training on Route 1 and you'd better not get lazy.
@mom{emotion="worried"}: And the professor called. Something about a cave north of Frostharbor that nobody has come back from. He said you'd know what that means.
::auto{character="mom" action="exit"}
@narrator: The Rift Cavern is open. Somewhere under Verdane, something very old is awake.
